From: (PLAN/179 pinned distribution)
Subject: [PATCH] notices: mark the files the toktier patch series modifies

Apache License 2.0 section 4(b) asks that modified files carry prominent
notices stating that they were changed. This adds one comment line at the
top of each of the seven source files the five-patch series touches,
pointing at NOTICE and CHANGES-toktier.md in this distribution. It changes
no code.

